{"name":"Chicago","hex":"#5b5d56","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Chicago","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A large city, the county seat of Cook County, in northeastern Illinois, United States, located on Lake Michigan."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any of various forms of the game of pool, designed for gambling."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Chicago"}],"entries":[{"title":"Chicago","blocks":[{"text":"Chicago is the most populous city in the U.S. state of Illinois and in the Midwestern United States. Located on the western shore of Lake Michigan, it is the third-most populous city in the United States and the fifth-most populous city in North America, with a population of 2.74 million at the 2020 census. The Chicago metropolitan area has approximately 9.62 million residents according to the 2020 census and is the third-largest metropolitan statistical area in the country and part of the fourth-largest combined statistical area in the United States, spanning 19 counties in three states and with a population of nearly 10 million. Chicago is the county seat of Cook County, the second-most populous county in the U.S."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Chicago_River_ferry_b.jpg/330px-Chicago_River_ferry_b.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chicago"},{"title":"Chicago (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Chicago is an American rock band formed in Chicago, Illinois, in 1967. Self-described as a \"rock and roll band with horns\", their songs often also combine elements of classical music, jazz, R&B, and pop music."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Chicago_performing_at_Caesars_Windsor%2C_2024-11-09_14.jpg/330px-Chicago_performing_at_Caesars_Windsor%2C_2024-11-09_14.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/